# DIRECTIVE-ONLY

AI access is `read-only-audit`; product-code writer is `human-developer-only`.

Do not modify the platform workspace. Do not write source, tests, migrations,
Storybook/config, generated output or patches. Do not create branches, commits, pushes or
pull requests. Inspect read-only and write the implementation directive in actionplan for
the human developer.
